{"3522090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HoBeey", "steam_appid": 3522090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/974568d68d204fda1d53dee658e59d7d.poster.avif?t=1777060239\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/974568d68d204fda1d53dee658e59d7d.webm?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/974568d68d204fda1d53dee658e59d7d.mp4?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HoBeey is a bee breeding simulator where your goal is to rediscover forgotten bee species, restore their populations, and revive an ancient bee altar. Build your apiary, breed the most productive bees, and master the art of sustainable honey production!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/e1fcd2e29d5c12fc3276fd2833fda2cb.poster.avif?t=1777060239\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/e1fcd2e29d5c12fc3276fd2833fda2cb.webm?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/e1fcd2e29d5c12fc3276fd2833fda2cb.mp4?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the bees from extinction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many bee species have been lost and forgotten. Find ways to rediscover them and restore their populations starting with just a small number of bees. To do this, you’ll need to build your apiary from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/c68612e976f516fc3b247dba7f0a9141.poster.avif?t=1777060239\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/c68612e976f516fc3b247dba7f0a9141.webm?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/c68612e976f516fc3b247dba7f0a9141.mp4?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your apiary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game in VR or without it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about genetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 8,000,000 gene combinations</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/974568d68d204fda1d53dee658e59d7d.poster.avif?t=1777060239\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/974568d68d204fda1d53dee658e59d7d.webm?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/974568d68d204fda1d53dee658e59d7d.mp4?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HoBeey is a bee breeding simulator where your goal is to rediscover forgotten bee species, restore their populations, and revive an ancient bee altar. Build your apiary, breed the most productive bees, and master the art of sustainable honey production!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/e1fcd2e29d5c12fc3276fd2833fda2cb.poster.avif?t=1777060239\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/e1fcd2e29d5c12fc3276fd2833fda2cb.webm?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/e1fcd2e29d5c12fc3276fd2833fda2cb.mp4?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the bees from extinction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many bee species have been lost and forgotten. Find ways to rediscover them and restore their populations starting with just a small number of bees. To do this, you’ll need to build your apiary from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/c68612e976f516fc3b247dba7f0a9141.poster.avif?t=1777060239\" width=1170 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/c68612e976f516fc3b247dba7f0a9141.webm?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522090/extras/c68612e976f516fc3b247dba7f0a9141.mp4?t=1777060239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Key Features:</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your apiary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game in VR or without it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about genetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 8,000,000 gene combinations</p></li></ul>", "short_d